      "kind": "fauna",
      "faction_id": "",
      "description": "Once a domestic companion, now a walking vector for necrotic fungal rot. Its ribcage heaves with swollen spore sacs, and every frantic bark expels a lethal cloud of caustic dust. To hear its rattling breath echoing in the fog is to know true, suffocating terror.",
